# Git Commit Message（SCM 生成提交消息）

When Cursor auto-generates a Git commit message for this repository:

## Language
- ALWAYS write commit messages in Simplified Chinese (简体中文).
- Never use English in subject or body.

## Format
Use Conventional Commits:

type(scope): 中文摘要

Allowed types:
feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, chore, revert

## Subject Rules
- Subject should summarize the main purpose of this change.
- Keep subject under 72 characters.
- Do not only describe a file name or module name.
- Include the key business or technical change.

## Body Rules
- ALWAYS generate a detailed body when code changes are involved.
- Explain WHAT changed and WHY.
- Include important implementation details.
- Summarize multiple related changes, do not omit secondary modifications.

Body format:

- 新增/修改/删除了什么功能
- 主要代码逻辑调整
- 重要接口、组件、页面或数据结构变化
- 修复的问题或优化点
- 影响范围（如果明显）

## Example

feat(user): 优化用户管理功能并增加批量操作能力

- 新增用户批量选择和批量禁用功能
- 调整用户列表查询逻辑，减少重复请求
- 增加用户状态校验，避免无效操作
- 修改用户接口参数结构，适配新的业务流程

## Important
- Do not generate overly short commit messages.
- Analyze git diff carefully before writing commit message.
- Include all meaningful changes from the diff.
- Do not simply summarize changed files.